# Screenshots are release assets: `screenshots.json` lists them, both READMEs
# embed them, and the plugin-market entry cannot render a card without them.
# These two rules are DEFENSIVE, not load-bearing today: nothing above matches
# `docs/`, so as the repository stands they change no outcome. They exist so a
# future broad rule (`*.png`, `assets/`, a catch-all) cannot silently swallow the
# marketplace images without anyone noticing.
!docs/assets/
!docs/assets/*.png